	(text "01 Raw HV input (W01), RAW_SS feeds to the preamp (W02) and PI + FX (W03) through link footprints (no fuses: user 2026-11-23), input filter, power star (grounding.md section 3), fault / RF network to the plated chassis standoff next to the raw input tabs, raw bleeder and HV indicator. No brake: the ramp energy goes back into the tube PSU (user 2026-11-21); the raw over-voltage trip is on sheet 05."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
